{"id": 6, "name": "Tigreal", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/b/b8/Hero061-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021140350", "cls": ["Tank", ""], "specialty": ["Crowd Control", ""], "difficulty": "10", "stats": ["80", "10", "100", "10"], "lanes": ["Roam", ""], "story": "Leader of the Light's Order, guardian of the Moniyan Empire.", "skills": [{"name": "Fearless", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_5b028ce65e323d962d7060705f59743f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Tigreal gains a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fearless</span> each time he uses a skill or is hit by a Basic Attack. After getting 4 stacks, Tigreal will consume all <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fearless</span> stacks to block the next incoming Basic Attack (including attacks from Turrets).\n\n<span style=\"color:#A4AAC7\">Attacks from Minions do not grant</span> <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fearless</span> <span style=\"color:#A4AAC7\">stacks nor trigger its effect</span>."}, {"name": "Attack Wave", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8e00063700ab16f53d840986b98aae25.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7   Mana Cost: 45", "desc": "Tigreal smashes the ground with his hammer and sends a shockwave that erupts 3 times in the target direction, each time dealing 270<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+70% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies along the fan-shaped area and slowing them by 20%/40%/60% for 1.5s."}, {"name": "Sacred Hammer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e9baf5e58ce0fb23c0fcb6176cc8ed5d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 83, "tagname": "Charge", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "c